<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/50 mb-12">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We collect what we need to run the service and nothing more. We don't sell
          your data. Your audio files are yours, and we delete them after processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          Munchy Cow is operated by [YOUR FULL NAME], located at [YOUR ADDRESS], Spain.
          You can contact us at privacy@munchycow.com.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Account Information</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              When you create an account, we collect your email address. We use
              magic links for authentication, so no password is stored by default.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Audio Files</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              You upload audio files for processing. We store these temporarily while
              processing and for a limited time afterward so you can download the results.
              Files are automatically deleted after 7 days.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Usage Data</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              We collect basic analytics about how you use the service: pages visited,
              features used, processing jobs created. This helps us improve the service.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Payment Information</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              If you purchase a subscription or minute packs, payment processing is
              handled by Polar. We don't store your full credit card number - only
              a reference to your payment record.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Legal Compliance</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
              As a Spanish entity, we may be required to share billing data with the
              Spanish Tax Agency (Hacienda) for accounting purposes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>To provide and improve the Service</li>
          <li>To communicate with you about your account</li>
          <li>To process payments</li>
          <li>To detect and prevent abuse</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Under GDPR, we process your data based on:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To provide the audio processing service you signed up for</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate Interest:</strong> To improve our service and prevent abuse</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Information Sharing</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We don't sell your personal information. We may share data with:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Service providers who help us operate (hosting, payment processing)</li>
          <li>Law enforcement if legally required</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Data Security</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including
          encryption in transit and at rest. Audio files are stored in encrypted
          cloud storage with access controls.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          Your data may be processed on servers located in the European Union and the
          United States. For transfers outside the EU, we rely on Standard Contractual
          Clauses approved by the European Commission to ensure your data is protected.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          You can:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-base-content/80 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Access your account data through the settings page</li>
          <li>Delete your account at any time</li>
          <li>Request a copy of your data by contacting us</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority (in Spain: Agencia Española de Protección de Datos)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We use essential cookies to keep you logged in and remember your preferences.
          We don't use tracking cookies for advertising.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          The Service is not intended for children under 13. We don't knowingly
          collect data from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this policy from time to time. We'll notify you of significant
          changes via email.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
          Questions about privacy? Contact us at privacy@munchycow.com.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-base-300">
      <.link href={locale_path(@locale, "/")} class="btn btn-ghost">
        &larr; Back to home
      </.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
